{"id": "32089", "title": "1984", "author": "乔治·奥威尔", "category": "文学名著", "count": 24, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/32/32089.htm", "intro": "《一九八四》于1949年6月8日由“塞克尔和沃伯格”公司出版。虽然奥威尔从1945年即开始创作《一九八四》，但小说的大部分是1948年他在苏格兰Jura岛写下的。这本小说有至少两位文学上的前辈。奥威尔熟悉俄国作家扎米亚京1921年的小说《我们》，他曾阅读此书的法文译本并在1946年写过评论。有报道指出奥威尔曾说他用此书作为他下一部小说的模型。批评家大多同意《我们》对《一九八四》产生过具有重要意义的影响。奥威尔亦为凯瑟琳·布德肯 (Katharine Burdekin) 1937年的《反乌托邦》(或称”敌托邦”)和《Swastika Night》着迷，并从中借用了描写未来世界的极权主义国家的主题，在这样的国家中在禁书中零散的碎片以外所有“真实的”历史都已经被抹去。", "base": "files/article/html/32/32089", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部", "volume": true}, {"title": "第01节", "file": "2072872.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02节", "file": "2072873.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03节", "file": "2072874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第04节", "file": "2072875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05节", "file": "2072876.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第06节", "file": "2072877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07节", "file": "2072878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第08节", "file": "2072879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部", "volume": true}, {"title": "第01节", "file": "2072880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02节", "file": "2072881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03节", "file": "2072882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第04节", "file": "2072883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05节", "file": "2072884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第06节", "file": "2072885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07节", "file": "2072886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第08节", "file": "2072887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第09节", "file": "2072888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10节", "file": "2072889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三部", "volume": true}, {"title": "第01节", "file": "2072890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02节", "file": "2072891.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03节", "file": "2072892.html", "available": false}